From 969a98d9c1e18276797e53239cea4e0c3d01683f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HenryChaing <n96121210@gs.ncku.edu.tw>
Date: Tue, 17 Jun 2025 23:12:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] Add Remoteproc Driver

The Remoteproc driver for Milk-V enables loading executable files to
the C906L core and provides the ability to reset the core as part of
the boot process.
---
