 linux_5.10/drivers/remoteproc/Makefile        |   1 +
 .../remoteproc/cvi_sg2002_c906l_remoteproc.c  | 159 ++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 178 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 linux_5.10/drivers/remoteproc/cvi_sg2002_c906l_remoteproc.c

